This is a separate helper program that Fushi starts as a child process. It links
the official Anki Rust library (rslib) from Anki @ANKI_TAG@, which is itself
AGPL-3.0-or-later, with the patches in native/fushi_anki_sync/patches/ applied
(they only change the sync client identity to "fushi,<version> (anki @ANKI_TAG@),<os>").

Corresponding source for this binary:
  Helper and patches: https://github.com/@REPO@/tree/@COMMIT@/native/fushi_anki_sync
  Anki upstream:      https://github.com/ankitects/anki/tree/@ANKI_TAG@ (commit @ANKI_COMMIT@)

Build instructions: native/fushi_anki_sync/README.md (build.sh on Linux/macOS,
build.ps1 on Windows).
